@startuml Sequence Diagram - UI Automation Fallback
participant "UI Trigger" as Trigger
participant "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "UI Automation Worker (OpenCV)" as Worker
participant "Input Simulator" as Simulator
participant "Client UI" as UI
participant "Orchestrator" as Feedback

Trigger -> Orchestrator: UI Event Detected
Orchestrator -> Worker: Request Automation
Worker -> Worker: Capture Screen (OpenCV)
Worker -> Worker: Analyze UI Elements
Worker -> Simulator: Generate Input Events
Simulator -> UI: Simulate Mouse/Keyboard
UI -> UI: Process Input
UI -> Worker: Visual Feedback (if applicable)
Worker -> Orchestrator: Automation Result
Orchestrator -> Feedback: Update State/Decision

note right: Feedback loop allows iterative adjustments based on UI response.

@enduml